	"about": "Synthetic only (#421). The unit test builds each file from these line specs at run time, so no multi-MiB payload is checked in. bytes is a line's exact length, newline included; a line without bytes keeps its natural size. call is an assistant usage line, tool a toolResult line (never counted). escapes fills the text with the escape string only. A torn line is written without its final newline. week-shaped follows the current-week measurements: lines over 64 KiB at line numbers 5-10 (most files' first one is line 8) in the 64K-256K, 256K-1M and 1M-4M bands, the largest at the cap.",
